  m_text: "Ko\u015Fucun kendili\u011Finden ileri ko\u015Far.\n\nZ\u0131plamak i\xE7in YUKARI KAYDIR.\nKaymak ya da havadan h\u0131zl\u0131 inmek i\xE7in A\u015EA\u011EI KAYDIR.\n\u015Eerit de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in SA\u011EA / SOLA KAYDIR.\n\nTepeg\xF6z kovalarken AT d\xFC\u011Fmesiyle ona karpuz f\u0131rlat. D\xF6rt isabette d\xFC\u015Fer!\n\nEngele \xE7arparsan ko\u015Fu biter. Hemen tekrar dene ve b\xF6l\xFCm\xFC ge\xE7!"
